    "norm": "Tests that {@link LocalDate#until} returns {@link Period#ZERO} when the end temporal is a {@link Symmetry010Date} that maps to the same ISO calendar day. <p> Each data row supplies a (Symmetry010Date, LocalDate) pair whose epoch-days are identical, so the period between them must be zero regardless of the calendar system."
   },
